  "solutionQuery": "SELECT student_name FROM FallExam WHERE score >= 60 UNION SELECT student_name FROM SpringExam WHERE score >= 60 ORDER BY student_name",
  "explanation": "Each branch filters its own exam table to passing scores (score >= 60); comparisons against NULL are unknown so Kai Nakamura is dropped. UNION (rather than UNION ALL) removes duplicates, so Ava Reyes and Grace Mwangi, who passed both exams, appear once. The trailing ORDER BY sorts the combined set alphabetically by student_name.",
